OL,4,T]
OL,6, Over the past few months, engineers
OL,7, have been working on theCCEEFAX
OL,8, computer system.
OL,10,FThey have now completed the final stage
OL,11,Fof this work. The BBC now has the most
OL,12,Fadvanced teletext system in the world.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FThere are still a few checks to be
OL,15,Fmade but our system should now be more
OL,16,Fefficient and flexible.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FFor you, the system will be more
OL,19,Freliable and there will be new features
OL,20,Fwhich will be appearing before long.
OL,21,F
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 14-03-82 / teletextarchive.com
