OL,3,T]Sj5jws 0jws 0jws ~o4ju j5jwsjuub{5
OL,4,T]
OL,6, Two American companies are to hold
OL,7, talks about a joint venture to provide
OL,8, a national teletext service in the US.
OL,10,FField Electronic Publishing of Chicago
OL,11,Fand Satellite Syndicated Systems of
OL,12,FTulsa, Oklahoma, intend to offer the
OL,13,Fservice to 18,500,000 homes.
OL,15,FIt would also be available to cable
OL,16,Fsubscribers with a teletext decoder.
OL,17,FThe new magazine wjll be demonstrated
OL,18,Fin Las Vegas in May.
OL,20,FField's teletext service is led by two
OL,21,Fformer members of the Ceefax team.
OL,23,T]CFrom 14-03-82 / teletextarchive.com
